# insta snapshot review files (transient — never commit)
# Inline snapshots are persisted directly into the source `.rs` files;
# `.pending-snap` files are temporary scratch generated during a failing
# snapshot diff that the developer reviews via `cargo insta review`.
*.pending-snap
# Watchman creates temporary cookie files for filesystem sync detection
.watchman-cookie-*
